repository-code: "https://github.com/aocbaeta/quantum_comp"
url: "https://github.com/aocbaeta/quantum_comp"
version: "v1.3-bcs-citation-package"
date-released: "2026-05-20"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible Python workflow for quantum simulation of the reduced BCS
  Hamiltonian, including exact dynamics, Trotterized circuits, Green functions,
  Qiskit shot/noise studies, zero-noise extrapolation, paper artifacts,
  notebooks, and automated validation.
keywords:
  - "quantum computing"
  - "BCS Hamiltonian"
  - "quantum simulation"
  - "Qiskit"
  - "Trotterization"
  - "Green functions"
